                <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Client libraries cannot tell MariaDB from MySQL or Valkey from Redis, so the spans say mysql or redis. A container image, a Helm chart or the Database Agent names the fork, and the database shows it, while its traces still land on the same page.</p>
