                <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Owners, Labels &amp; Retention</h3>
                <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Give every database owning teams and users, label it, and let label and owner rules pick databases up by name: a pattern of <code class="text-sm bg-gray-100 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">^PostgreSQL</code> matches every PostgreSQL database. Retention is set per database, for the telemetry collected from the database itself.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Card 5: AI -->
