                <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">While OneUptime AI investigates an incident, the Database AI agent beside the collector answers with sessions, long-running queries, locks and replication state for PostgreSQL, MySQL, Redis and MongoDB. It is read-only unless you allow a fix, such as cancelling one query, and you choose whether each fix waits for a person's approval.</p>
